Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,世人沉睡的时候，恐惧，战兢，临到我身
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.59,Title,0,0,0,0,,《猛鬼街4：梦幻主宰》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.48,0:02:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你住在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello. - Do you live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有人住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody lives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.16,0:02:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 佛莱迪在哪里 - 他不在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Freddy? - Heh, heh. He's not home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.80,0:03:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 佛莱迪要来抓你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, Freddy's coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.80,0:03:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 四 锁好你的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, four, better lock your door.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.08,0:03:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,五 六 快去拿十字架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five, six, grab your crucifix.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.20,0:04:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点 克莉丝丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be calm, Kristen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔伊 金凯德 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joey! Kincaid! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 克莉丝丹 又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit, Kristen. Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.64,0:05:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 金凯德 - 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry, Kincaid. - Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:05:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个可怕的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are one spooked chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢天谢地 刚刚我还以为 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank God. I thought for a minute…- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.52,0:06:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你把我们拖到这里来 - 对 别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dragging us in here? - Yeah. Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你严重影响到我睡美容觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're putting one serious dent in my beauty sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.00,0:06:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是佛莱迪 他在这里 我听到他的声音了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Freddy. He's here. I heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.32,0:06:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛莱迪死了 他被火化埋葬 我们赢了 还记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy is dead, buried and consecrated. We won, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.96,0:06:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他回来找我们 - 金凯德说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's coming back for us. - Kincaid's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.60,0:06:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛莱迪·克鲁格已经成了过去 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fred Krueger's history. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.84,0:06:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些水管是冷的 锅炉也是冷的 你自己看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pipes are cold. The boiler is cold. See for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.08,0:06:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.24,0:08:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 强森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you, Mr. Johnson?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条领带很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.16,0:08:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹 瑞克马上出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Kristen. Rick will be out any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.00,0:08:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要打扮成那样出门 - 这次又有什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You going out dressed like that? - What's wrong with it this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.44,0:08:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我到车边等 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I might just wait by the car. - Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 楼梯坏了吗 - 今天是全面避免接触日\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something wrong with the stairs? - It's Avoid All Contact Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.28,0:08:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.76,0:08:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,当爸拼命吃阿斯匹林时 就是全面避免接触日\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Dad's popping aspirin like popcorn, it's Avoid All Contact Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.24,0:08:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在等礼车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for a limo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm off to the club, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 这学期谁修三角函数\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, anybody have trig this semester?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.72,0:09:10.83,Title,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 时间冲突 做功课还是看《朝代》\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - I had a conflict. Homework or Dynasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:12.55,Title,0,0,0,0,,结果《朝代》赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, Dynasty won.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可悲了 肥皂剧会要了你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sad story. Soaps will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.48,0:09:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹·乔登来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. There's Dan Jordan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可真是个大师哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm. We are talking one major league hunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.60,0:09:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个大师哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you are one major league hunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 艾莉丝 - 地球呼叫艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Heh. Thanks, Alice. - Earth to Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.32,0:09:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 地球呼叫艾莉丝 你又恍神了 - 瑞克 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Earth to Alice. Hey, you spacing again? - Rick, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.28,0:09:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 他是我的朋友 我可以帮你介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, tell you what, he's a friend of mine. I'll introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.36,0:09:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞克 - 开玩笑的 可是我会真的帮她介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rick. - Just kidding. But I would introduce her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.44,0:09:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 我想我的救星来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I think I see salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.04,0:10:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能骑这辆危害健康的车 难怪你会有气喘\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you ride this health hazard? It's no wonder that you have asthma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 听着 气喘是遗传疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you see, asthma is an inherited condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.76,0:10:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶尔看书能增进知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read a book now and then, you might know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.48,0:10:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到看书 三角函数不是你的最爱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, speaking of books, isn't trig your favorite?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.76,0:10:19.95,Title,0,0,0,0,,你又在看《朝代》了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dynasty again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,小戴 帮大家一个忙 买部录影机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deb, do us a favor and get a VCR.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.72,0:10:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你吸错东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, baby, you're sucking on the wrong nozzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.64,0:10:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 三寸钉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, yo, needle dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你是学校里唯一有生殖崇拜问题的男生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you're the only male in this school suffering from penis envy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.84,0:10:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.80,0:10:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真恶心 - 女超人 他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So disgusting. - Hey, super girl, it's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,饶了那只虫子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give a bug a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.76,0:11:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好 昨晚那样子 你只能这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, guys? That's all you have to say after last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.40,0:11:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得小心一点 我是认真的 他回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better be careful. I'm telling you, he's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.24,0:11:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你有超能力 能把别人拉到你的梦里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you got this freak-o talent to bring folks into your dream…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.24,0:11:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不需要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but we don't need it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.12,0:11:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该开始过正常生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to start living like regular people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.81,0:11:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 忘了那一切 我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Let it rest. I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.80,0:11:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有想过老是记得反而会把他引来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…did it ever occur to you that if you keep going in, you might stir him up again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.84,0:11:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们可以帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.44,0:11:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有更美好的梦可以做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have better things to dream about.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.48,0:11:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对 就那么说定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that right. Signed and sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.44,0:11:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那这又是怎么一回事 - 那没什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then what about this? - That don't mean dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.28,0:11:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的狗跟我很像 把它拉进你的疯狂梦里 它会抓狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dog is like me. Drag him into your crazy dream, and he gets wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你男朋友来了 他能让你一夜好眠吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here comes your boyfriend. Can he give you a good night's sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.44,0:11:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会跟别人说自己的私事 你们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't kiss and tell. How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.16,0:11:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 待会儿再谈 好吗 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, we'll talk later, all right? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.28,0:11:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那两个男生怪怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guys are kind of spooky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.84,0:12:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么你一定觉得我是怪胎 - 我一直无法下定决心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then you must think I'm a total freak. - I go back and forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.64,0:12:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 又没有人死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, lighten up. No one died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.16,0:13:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.72,0:13:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在找东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,猪头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shithead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.60,0:13:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迟到了 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Iate. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的合约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn contracts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.24,0:13:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,开动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.12,0:13:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们等了很久 - 所以我们不等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know, we waited a long time. - And we gave up, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天工作了十小时 你让我吃青草\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call this vegetation a meal after a ten-hour workday?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我算什么 你当我是兔子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell am l, a rabbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.44,0:14:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 艾莉丝 多用点脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ, Alice, try to think a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.16,0:14:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我会用脑子 想到我有多么厌倦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I can think. I can think of how sick I am…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.40,0:14:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着你酗酒然后把气发在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of watching you drink your life away and taking it out on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.16,0:14:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 我在跟你说话 你是清醒的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, Alice, I'm talking to you. Are you awake or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.44,0:14:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸 别说了 - 别说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad, don't start. - Start what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.24,0:14:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,要爱做白日梦的人保持清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Telling the little daydreamer to wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's long overdue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.64,0:14:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要这样的挑衅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need this aggravation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.08,0:15:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森 快过来 真是只乖狗狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason. Come on, boy. Come on. Come on. That's a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.32,0:15:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点没吓死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You almost scared me, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快打开后车厢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, open this sucker up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.40,0:15:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.20,0:15:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't my dreamland.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.04,0:15:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kristen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:15:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在这里 我一定要痛扁你一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're here, I'm gonna pound your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:15:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.32,0:16:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jason?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.44,0:17:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking A.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.88,0:18:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不该埋葬我 我没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have buried me. I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.28,0:19:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧 王八蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹 佛莱迪回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kristen, Freddy's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:20:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛莱迪回来了 佛莱迪回来了 佛莱迪回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy's back! Freddy's back! Freddy's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.84,0:20:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.88,0:20:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他们说佛莱迪送你过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them Freddy sent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.12,0:20:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决一个 还有两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One down, two to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.40,0:21:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,MTV台 挑战理性\N{\fnArial\fs30}MTV in stereo defies the mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.52,0:21:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,用音乐神游太空\N{\fnArial\fs30}Illusions of space through sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.76,0:21:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有泪水流下\N{\fnArial\fs30}There may be teardrops to shed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.28,0:21:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从寒冷中进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming in from the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.20,0:21:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每天早上起床后会看几小时的MTV台\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watch MTV every morning when I get up for a couple of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.36,0:21:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,早餐时会边吃边看\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then right around breakfast time, you know, I watch a little bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.04,0:21:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,午餐时我会喂鱼 边喂鱼边看MTV台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then about lunch when I feed the fish, you know, I feed the fish and watch them…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.60,0:22:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.76,0:22:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎样一场春梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's this for a wet dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.44,0:22:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kristen! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.52,0:22:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乔伊 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Joey. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.44,0:23:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.32,0:23:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样反而没有用 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of defeats the purpose, don't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.28,0:23:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 镜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - The mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.52,0:23:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看不到镜子里的自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't see yourself in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.28,0:23:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想照镜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.12,0:23:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果妈还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if Mom was still alive…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.68,0:23:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸不会这样对我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Dad wouldn't treat us Iike this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.36,0:24:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 你得学会为自己挺身而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, you gotta learn to stand up for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.32,0:24:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.44,0:24:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像那样 一些皆由心生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that. It's all in the mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.88,0:24:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会发现自己采取行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see yourself doing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.79,0:24:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,身体自然地做出反应 譬如说\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your body reacts and does it. Like so:
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.60,0:24:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就像那样 你来试试看 - 我吗 不 我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like that. Now you do it. - Me? No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.84,0:24:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 你可以的 - 不 我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, yeah, you can. - No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.92,0:24:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你可以的 站起来这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, yes, you can. Just get up there and just…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.88,0:24:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像那样 用点力 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that. Big and strong. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.44,0:24:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 艾莉丝 你得注意平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, good. But, Alice-san, you must have balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.52,0:24:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So go to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.56,0:24:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 你杀死一只鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swish. Killed a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.76,0:24:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.00,0:24:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,边吃边看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I watch it for a little bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.48,0:24:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,午餐时我会喂鱼 边喂鱼边看MTV台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then about lunch, when I feed the fish, you know, I feed the fish and watch…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.36,0:24:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔伊 老是得帮你收脏衣服 我烦死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joey, I'm getting tired of picking up your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.24,0:24:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个烂频道 该把电视关掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this crap, I wish you'd turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.52,0:25:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.76,0:25:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.56,0:25:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上你跑到哪里去了 瑞克到处找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you this morning? Rick's looking all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.32,0:25:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有看到乔伊跟金凯德吗 到处找不到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen Joey and Kincaid? I can't find them anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.44,0:25:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们应该在学校里 - 嗯 我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sure they're around. - Yeah, well, I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.32,0:25:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得比看看谁的比较大\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have matching luggage again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.28,0:25:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的眼袋 做恶梦了吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The bags under your eyes. Nightmares? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.08,0:25:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我讨厌做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I hate dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.60,0:25:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢做梦 我只是讨厌梦到我爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, I love to dream. I just hate the ones about my Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.92,0:25:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,做恶梦时你会怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you handle your nightmares?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.92,0:26:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,小时候我妈妈教我一招\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Mom taught me when I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.84,0:26:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听过梦的主人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever hear of the dream master?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.84,0:26:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得那像是益智节目主持人 - 不 那是首童谣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sounds like a game show host to me. - No, it's a rhyme.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.80,0:26:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须梦到一个有趣的地方 记住 一切由你控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just have to dream about someplace fun. Remember, you're in control.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.00,0:26:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会这么了解梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know so much about dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.20,0:26:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你只剩下梦 当然会变成专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when it's all you have, you kind of become an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.24,0:26:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快走吧 免得你哥组织搜索队来找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We better get going before your brother starts a search party.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.64,0:26:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之我一直无法理解卡夫卡跟歌德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, Kafka and Goethe have never been irreconcilable to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.56,0:26:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉丝 你跑到哪里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kris, where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.92,0:26:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,金凯德 乔伊 不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kincaid, Joey. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.16,0:26:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 他杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, what? - He killed them!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.60,0:26:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 等一下 冷静点 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? Wait. Calm down. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.64,0:27:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,舒服一点了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeling better now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.56,0:27:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,舒服一点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.08,0:27:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.04,0:27:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的头重重地撞了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had quite a nasty bump.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.56,0:27:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得离开这里 - 不 你得留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I gotta get out of here! - No, no, no. You stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.40,0:27:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need your rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.64,0:27:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不了解 他在追杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get it. He's after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.24,0:27:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 甜 ｡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.12,0:27:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得帮你抽点血 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wanna draw some blood. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.84,0:27:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.08,0:27:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,舒服一点了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeling better now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.24,0:27:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.16,0:27:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的头重重地撞了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had quite a nasty bump.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.88,0:28:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想成为你的骄傲和喜悦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna be your pride and joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.80,0:28:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会不会把我当成一个小玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't you treat me like a little toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.68,0:28:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有看到瑞克吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seen Rick around?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.44,0:28:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 你是他妹妹 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Well, you are his sister, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.28,0:28:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克放学后还待在学校里 克莉丝丹不太舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, Rick stayed late after school. Kristen wasn't feeling very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.64,0:28:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能跟他说我在找他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you tell him I'm looking for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.08,0:28:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我是丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, by the way, I'm Dan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.40,0:28:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 艾莉丝 你下班了 我来服务他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Alice. Your shift's over. My table now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.16,0:28:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好 丹 你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, guys. Hi, Dan. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.00,0:29:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我要可乐跟薯条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Um, can I get just a Coke and some fries?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.32,0:29:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要听一下特餐内容还是要吃些甜点呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna hear our specials or do you want any dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.48,0:29:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,大师哥 要来点面包吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hi, handsome. Care for some buns?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.36,0:29:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去吧 你在赶时间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. You in a hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.36,0:29:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得趁图书馆关门前赶过去 该死的物理学小考\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get to the library before it closes. Killer physics test.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.72,0:29:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 我根本没有时间念书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I hardly have any time to study.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.28,0:29:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该在这里工作那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you shouldn't be working here so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.48,0:29:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想一辈子当服务生吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna get stuck waiting tables the rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.52,0:29:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 那是我最大的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. It's my greatest fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.72,0:29:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的很帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he is so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.68,0:29:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不知道他在哪里健身 - 省省力气吧 小戴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wonder where he works out? - Save it, Deb.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.36,0:29:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了运动 还有别的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, there is life after exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.48,0:29:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 我会帮你介绍一个真正的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of these days, I'm gonna set you up with a real guy…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.84,0:29:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你知道你该做什么才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}…teach you to get your priorities straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.12,0:29:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想席拉宁可解剖尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Sheila's more interested in dissecting bodies…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.88,0:29:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也不愿意看人们的外表 - 给她一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …than looking at the outside. - Give her time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.36,0:29:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的荷尔蒙总有一天会大爆发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her hormones will kick in some day.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.52,0:29:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,小戴 总有一天 你会了解我的座右铭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deb, you know, later in life, you're gonna appreciate my motto.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.40,0:29:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么座右铭 - 知性胜过物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - Mind over matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.12,0:29:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 待会儿见 好吗 再见 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, I'll see you later, okay? Bye. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.36,0:29:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 艾莉丝 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye, Alice. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.20,0:30:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾莉丝 你能下班了吗 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alice, can you leave here? - What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.96,0:30:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚金凯德跟乔伊都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kincaid and Joey died last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.32,0:30:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.64,0:30:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 瑞克 瑞克 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Rick. Rick! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.48,0:30:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,陪着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.24,0:30:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹 发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kristen, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.08,0:30:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你会听到各种说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're gonna hear all kinds of stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.56,0:30:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起经历了那么多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after all we've been through together…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.40,0:30:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么能让他杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…how could I let him get to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.12,0:30:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾是一个团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.32,0:30:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要逮到那个混蛋 - 谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna get that son of a bitch. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.64,0:30:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, we gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.12,0:30:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now. - I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.32,0:30:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 马上回来 - 免得太迟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be right back. - Before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.04,0:30:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得走了 待会儿再谈 - 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I gotta go. I guess I'll talk to you later. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.76,0:30:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要到鬼屋来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, why the haunted house?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.72,0:31:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是一般的房子 这里是他家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not just a house. It's his home.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.24,0:31:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在里面等着我做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's waiting in there for me to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.60,0:31:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 我们会陪着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's okay. We're with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.12,0:31:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过你是帮不了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, you can't help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.56,0:31:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是一般的恶梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a normal nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.44,0:31:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm history.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.60,0:31:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.52,0:31:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 我错过了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - What'd I miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.96,0:31:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟我们提起佛莱迪的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told us a story about Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.20,0:31:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛莱迪·克鲁格 他是本镇的传奇人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fred Krueger. He's a town legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.64,0:31:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是杀童凶手 不过因为程序问题获释\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a child killer freed on a technicality.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.04,0:31:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以呢 - 一些家长很不满\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - So a lot of parents got pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.28,0:31:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据克莉丝的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And according to Kris…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.64,0:31:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们抓住他 把他当成感恩节火鸡一样烧死\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they hunted him down and roasted him like a Thanksgiving turkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.88,0:31:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不错的社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.16,0:31:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 总之怪的地方就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Anyway, that's where it gets weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.08,0:31:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说他会在梦里回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, she says that he comes back in dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.00,0:31:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他在你的梦里杀了你 你是真的死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he kills you in your dream, you're dead for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.88,0:31:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要进入梦乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I lay me down to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.12,0:32:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦的主人 我要留住我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The master of dreams, my soul I'll keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.48,0:32:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦的主人 我就知道我记得那首童谣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dream master, I think I remember the rhyme.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.52,0:32:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹 离那间房子远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kristen, get the hell away from that house!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.40,0:32:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不愿意的话 别离开 我会保护你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey, you don't have to go if you don't want to. I'll take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.08,0:32:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我最好离开 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I better go. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.68,0:32:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我会打电话给你 我们会一起度过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll call you tonight, and we'll get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.36,0:32:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 好的 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Okay. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.96,0:32:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.76,0:32:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.16,0:32:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐驾驶位旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shotgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.68,0:33:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,菜不好吃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something the matter with the cuisine?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.44,0:33:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Mom, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.72,0:33:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你两个朋友在同一天死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When two of your friends die in the same day…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.96,0:33:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你还能吃得下东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Iet me know what it does to your appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.20,0:33:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你累了 别以为我没注意到你一直没睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're tired. Don't think I haven't noticed that you haven't been sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.80,0:33:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能再这样 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That has got to stop, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.52,0:33:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是怎么了 - 青春期焦虑 你会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong with me? - Adolescent anxiety. That'll make it better.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.64,0:33:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 妈 你做了什么 - 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God. Mom, what did you do? - Oh, Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.36,0:33:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 安眠药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, sleeping pills?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.72,0:33:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 克莉丝丹 对不起 我 - 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, Kristen, I'm sorry. I'm just… - Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.76,0:33:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉你跟你的球友烧死这家伙 现在他要追杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry that you and your tennis pals torched this guy, and now he's after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.84,0:33:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你一直没注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case you haven't been keeping score…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.08,0:34:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经他妈的计划好了 我是他最后的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's his fucking banquet, and I'm the last course!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.08,0:34:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹 我们在心理医生那里谈过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kristen, we went over this in therapy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.20,0:34:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 妈妈 你害死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, mother. You just murdered me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.80,0:34:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你跟你的心理治疗去死吧 - 克莉丝丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take that to your goddamn therapy. - Kristen!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.12,0:34:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kristen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.80,0:34:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kristen?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.68,0:34:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.00,0:34:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice. Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.68,0:35:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦到有趣的地方 梦到有趣的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dream someplace fun. Dream someplace fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.92,0:35:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dream some…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.56,0:35:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, AIice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.04,0:35:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 小妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.12,0:35:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.56,0:35:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么名字 - 艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's your name? - Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.92,0:35:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友也叫艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a friend named Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.88,0:36:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.04,0:37:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,榆树街最后一个小鬼 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elm Street's last brat. Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.68,0:37:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们曾经打败过你 - 现在你只剩下一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We beat you before! - And now you're all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.96,0:37:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹 你何不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kristen, why don't you, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.48,0:37:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼唤你的朋友 或许他们会帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…call on one of your little friends? Maybe they could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.72,0:37:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我是最后一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never! I'm the last!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.68,0:37:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你不找人帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you reach out and touch someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.60,0:37:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.16,0:38:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.28,0:38:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.48,0:38:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.20,0:38:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.52,0:38:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}How sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.56,0:38:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,新鲜货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fresh meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.76,0:38:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 醒一醒 快逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, wake up and get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.96,0:38:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 真的很抱歉 这是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, I'm so sorry. It was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.92,0:38:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拉你来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pulled you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.40,0:38:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 到爸爸这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, come to Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.32,0:38:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了她 你这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave her alone, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.96,0:38:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在谁都不能睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now no one sleeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.56,0:38:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.08,0:38:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我孩子们的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The souls of my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.96,0:38:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.68,0:38:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会需要我的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll need my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.84,0:39:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 克莉丝丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - Kristen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.12,0:39:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹 我们得去她家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kristen, we've gotta get to her house.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.16,0:39:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kristen!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.12,0:40:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 克莉丝丹 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! Kristen! Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.04,0:40:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开我 - 不 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me go. - No. Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.20,0:40:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 真希望你也来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Alice. Wish you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.44,0:40:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾莉丝 - 你的讨厌哥哥又在玩老把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, Alice. - Your brother's up to his old tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.92,0:40:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 自从认识你以来 我一直都想问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, as long as I've known you, I've always wanted to ask…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.88,0:40:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在头发上抹了什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}… what the hell this shit is that you put in your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.80,0:40:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞克 跟我们谈谈你的性生活 - 不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rick, tell us about your sex life. - Oh, no. Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.44,0:40:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 我很抱歉 - 不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Sorry. - We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.16,0:40:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 不 你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - No. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.12,0:40:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说过我要他的身体 - 那是胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told you. I want his body. - Oh, that's bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.20,0:40:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还要什么 - 她要我的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What else do you want? - She wants my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.04,0:40:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莉丝丹是我唯一的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kristen 's my only friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.56,0:40:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她是我唯一的朋友 - 对不起 我想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She 's my only friend. - Excuse me. I would like…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.80,0:40:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.12,0:40:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.16,0:40:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会儿见 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.72,0:41:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.56,0:41:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能让我舒服一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.84,0:41:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力 打中球 一定会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit it. Hit the ball, everything will be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.28,0:41:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我一定会弄伤别人 - 用力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna hurt somebody. - Hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.60,0:41:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.00,0:41:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝贝 - 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, baby. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.68,0:41:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时你让她非常快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made her so happy then.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.04,0:41:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 直到佛莱迪出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Until all this Freddy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.32,0:41:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么我没陪着她 - 结果还是会一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why didn't I just stay with her? - lt wouldn't have made any difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.64,0:41:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会不一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure it would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.88,0:41:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.16,0:41:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在梦里都看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it happen in my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.40,0:41:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有个可怕的男人 - 谁 佛莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And there was this horrible man. - Oh, who? Freddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.96,0:41:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛莱迪 我不想再听到佛莱迪的事 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy? I don't wanna hear about Freddy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.24,0:41:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到克莉丝丹满口都是这些事 我不想再听了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard it all from Kristen. I don't wanna hear any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.96,0:41:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还可以闻到烟味\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could smell the smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.28,0:41:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还可以感觉到大火的热度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could feel the heat from the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.76,0:41:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那不是梦 - 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lt wasn't a dream! - Just stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.60,0:41:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没疯 你也没有 别说了 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wasn't crazy and neither are you, so just cut it out. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.60,0:42:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez, why are you acting this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.48,0:42:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.92,0:42:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得自己不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just feel so different.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.36,0:42:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦里发生了一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened in the dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.84,0:42:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在一部分的她在我的身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now it's like part of her is with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.00,0:42:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.16,0:42:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克莉丝丹帕克小姐 天啊 - 我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Miss Kristen Parker. Oh, my. - I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.48,0:42:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.00,0:42:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,姊妹 我累死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phew, girl, I am so dead on my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.48,0:42:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得比赛谁的眼袋比较大\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have matching luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.32,0:42:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么意思 - 昨晚你没睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean? - You didn't sleep last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.76,0:42:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么明显啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that obvious, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.40,0:42:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你也看到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you saw him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.12,0:42:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到谁了 我整晚没睡都在念物理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw who? I mean, I was up all night cramming for that physics test.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.16,0:42:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还做了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! And I put this little baby together.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.92,0:42:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道小戴多么怕虫子 我帮她做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how Deb's afraid of bugs. Well, I made it for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.00,0:42:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,超高频音波\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultra-high soundwaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.32,0:42:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,会把虫子吓走 吓到他们的触须掉下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make them run, screaming their antennas off.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.52,0:43:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,课堂上见 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'll see you in class, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.72,0:43:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不抽烟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.96,0:43:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 考试时间是四十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you've got 40 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.20,0:43:36.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（考试日）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.52,0:43:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝大家好运 开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So good luck and go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.12,0:45:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 救救我 醒一醒 醒一醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice. Help me. Help! Wake up! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.81,0:45:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊 救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.80,0:45:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒一醒 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.40,0:46:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要亲一下吗 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wanna suck face? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.60,0:46:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,席拉 醒一醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheila, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.60,0:46:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,席拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheila!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.88,0:46:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被当掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You flunked.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.36,0:46:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,席拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheila.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.84,0:46:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,席拉 快给她药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheila. Give her her thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.04,0:46:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没看到吗 他在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you see it? He was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.20,0:46:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾莉丝 你在胡说什么 - 他在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alice, what are you talking about? - He was here!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.56,0:47:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托大家让一让\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.68,0:47:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请退后 别过来 - 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Step back please. Stand back. - Step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.28,0:47:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,气喘发作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asthma attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.92,0:47:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.96,0:47:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么17岁女孩会有致命气喘\N{\fnArial\fs30}What 17-year-old has fatal asthma?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.22,0:47:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 她本来想当医生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, she was gonna be a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.28,0:47:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是佛莱迪干的 - 别胡说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lt was Freddy. - Enough with that crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.00,0:47:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都看到了 说在我的梦里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it. It was my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.44,0:47:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将席拉带到我的梦里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought Sheila in.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.08,0:47:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.12,0:47:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把席拉带到梦里 就像克莉丝丹把我带到梦里一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought Sheila in like Kristen did with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.08,0:47:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要 我把席拉送给他 现在她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't. I gave Sheila to him. And now she's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.48,0:47:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 我真的认为 克莉丝丹的故事开始影响到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Rick, I really think Kristen's story is getting to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.76,0:48:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹 我不认为那只是个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan, I really don't know if it's a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.68,0:48:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看我们 我们一个个死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at us. We're dropping off like flies here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.92,0:48:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 幸会 保重 再见 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good to see you. Take care. Bye. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.64,0:48:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.72,0:48:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等不及要见你 你的图片不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait to see you. Your picture ain't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.08,0:49:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等不及要碰你本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't wait to touch you in the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.68,0:49:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 小姐 能给我一包口香糖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, miss. Can I get a pack of gum?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.36,0:49:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑到哪里去了 最近我一直没看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Where you been? I haven't seen you around lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.88,0:49:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都在加班\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been working double shifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.96,0:49:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你需要钱 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess you need the extra money, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.12,0:49:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 你知道为什么 你只是不想相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you know why. You just don't wanna believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.60,0:49:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不了解吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.72,0:49:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.72,0:49:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会有人死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone might die.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.72,0:49:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇见你女朋友 你是如此神圣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Met you with a girlfriend. You were so divine.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.52,0:49:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 假设这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, let's say that, uh, this is real, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.28,0:49:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么佛莱迪突然间要追杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, uh, all of a sudden is this Freddy guy after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.32,0:50:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀害佛莱迪的那些人所生的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kristen was the last child left of.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.50,0:50:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一个活口说是克莉丝丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}the people who killed Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.32,0:50:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许佛莱迪无法杀害新的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Freddy can't get to the new kids…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.24,0:50:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非有人将其他的孩子带到他面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}…unless there's someone to bring them to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.44,0:50:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 我们要来不及去露天电影院了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny, we're gonna be late for the drive in.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.40,0:50:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得回去工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.56,0:50:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会儿见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I guess I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.56,0:50:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你说你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause if you say hello. It'll mean you wanna see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.20,0:50:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那意味着你本人要见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.12,0:50:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过93天就放暑假了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ninety-three days till summer vacation, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.48,0:50:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 你累了吗 - 不 我只是担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the matter, you tired? - No, I'm getting worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.24,0:50:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看看我们能不能撑到暑假 这跟狩猎季节差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see if we can make it until summer. It's like open season around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.12,0:50:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了很多怪事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty weird stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.80,0:50:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到奇怪 你得同情那个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of weird, you gotta feel for that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.80,0:50:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,女朋友死了 妹妹是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead girlfriend, basket case for a sister…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.92,0:50:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何不学着闭嘴 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you learn to shut up, asshole?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.96,0:51:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 真是个王八蛋 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God, what a dick. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.32,0:51:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你似乎很累 - 我一直在陪艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You look wasted, man. - I've been up with Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.56,0:51:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还好吧 昨晚我在餐厅里看到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how's she doing? I, uh, saw her last night at the diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.16,0:51:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她因席拉的死自责\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's blaming herself for Sheila.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.48,0:51:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能了解她的感觉 我一直都在想克莉丝丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how she feels. I mean, I think about Kristen all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.68,0:51:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该相信她的 或许此能阻止这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, maybe I could have stopped it if I'd have listened.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.68,0:51:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是指佛莱迪吗 - 不然呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mean, uh, Freddy? - What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.88,0:51:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你查过本镇的历史吗 在这里当青少年真的很不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever take a look at our town's history? It's not a safe place to be a teenager.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.92,0:51:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们 该走了 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bozos, let's hustle. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.60,0:51:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我是下一个 你得小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if I'm next, watch your back, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.48,0:51:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说到哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.36,0:51:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个古代社会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every society dating back to the ancients…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.48,0:51:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有关于梦的理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has had theories regarding dreams…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.12,0:51:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚里斯多德 游荡的灵魂 也就是如何控制梦境\N{\fnArial\fs30}…what they mean, how to control them.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.52,0:52:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚里斯多德相信人睡着后 灵魂会四处游荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aristotle believed that during sleep, your soul roams free.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.20,0:52:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂看到的事说是梦境\N{\fnArial\fs30}What it sees are dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.88,0:52:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有技巧的做梦者 可以控制自己看到的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The skilled dreamers, well, they are able to control what they see.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.08,0:52:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个神话指出 灵魂可以进入两扇大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a myth that there's two gates your soul can enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.28,0:52:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一是正面的大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}One is a positive gate…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.16,0:52:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有负面的大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the other, a negative gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.84,0:52:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键是有个梦的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key element is that there's a dream master…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.52,0:52:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他守护着正面的大门 事实上他是在保护睡着的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…someone who guards the positive gate and, in fact, protects the sleeping host.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.00,0:52:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,整体来说 这些说法提供了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taken altogether, they offer a fascinating perspective…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.16,0:52:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常迷人的古老历史观\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on ancient history.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.92,0:52:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不觉得有趣的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now those of you who don't find it fascinating…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.40,0:52:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好注意听着 因为期末考会考这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you better listen up, because it's gonna be on the final.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.24,0:53:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 逗我笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.96,0:53:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,电梯向下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.28,0:53:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.56,0:54:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的战士不需要眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}A true warrior needs no eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.32,0:54:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出来跟我打 你这个胆小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on out and fight me, you chickenshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.56,0:54:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍者战士必须冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ninja warriors have calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.84,0:54:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你的平衡 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find your balance, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.60,0:54:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你胆小到不敢现身吗 克鲁格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too wimpy to show yourself, Krueger?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.36,0:54:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的平衡可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how's this for balance?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.72,0:54:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.88,0:55:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有武器 要怎么跟我打 佛莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you gonna fight me without your weapon, Freddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.48,0:55:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sayonara, Rick-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.76,0:55:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.24,0:55:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我虽然走过死荫的幽谷 也不怕遭害\N{\fnArial\fs30}…through the valley of the shadow of death, I shall fear no evil…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.84,0:55:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你与我同在 你的杖 你的竿\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for thou art with me with thy rod and thy staff…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.08,0:55:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 今天我们来到这里 哀悼瑞克·强森之死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dearly bereaved, we gather here in remorse for Rick Johnson.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.92,0:55:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个年轻人的死让我们感到悲伤 也百思不得其解\N{\fnArial\fs30}A young man whose death confounds and mystifies us…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.04,0:55:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克正值青春 大家都爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for Rick was in his prime, beloved by all…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.40,0:55:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,代表着年轻人的理想\N{\fnArial\fs30}…exemplary of young men's ideals…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.36,0:55:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟坚强的道德观\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and of strong moral fiber.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.88,0:55:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为我们的损失感到悲伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}We grieve our loss,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.65,0:55:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,也很安慰我们知道这样的一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but take comfort in knowing such a man…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.60,0:56:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,会在上帝的国度里安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}…rests in the kingdom of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.76,0:56:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们用信念取代知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let our faith supersede our knowledge…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.24,0:56:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为上帝的作为自有其道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for truly the Lord works in mysterious ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.80,0:56:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.72,0:56:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱死这一切了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I Iove this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.48,0:56:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为我死了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think I'm dead, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.44,0:56:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真的太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.08,0:56:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛哭呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. What's with the tears?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.64,0:56:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会离开你的 来吧 别哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't leave you. Come on, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.88,0:56:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里 这是开玩笑了 为了骗佛莱迪开的玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here. It was a joke. A big joke to fool Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.40,0:56:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 笑一个给我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, smile for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.24,0:56:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不做白日梦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more daydreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.24,0:56:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.44,0:57:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.32,0:57:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.04,0:57:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点都不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.60,0:57:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么是我们能帮忙的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything we can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.92,0:57:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想应该没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.44,0:57:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我一个人的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess this is my own war.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.44,0:57:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.12,0:57:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都得活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.56,0:57:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我花那么多时间运动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look, I don't spend hours working out…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.96,0:57:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不会让一个黑夜跟踪狂打败我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to let some night stalker beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.72,0:57:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't really get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.20,0:57:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是黑夜跟踪狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a night stalker.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.52,0:57:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,光做卧推是无法打败他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it'll take more than bench presses to beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.72,0:57:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们该怎么办 - 今晚到戴比家碰面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, what do we do? - Let's go over to Debbie's tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.40,0:57:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得计划一下 - 艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to make a plan. - Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.44,0:57:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.88,0:57:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 八点我到餐厅接你好吗 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How about I pick you up at the diner at 8? - Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.20,0:57:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去吧 这是幸运手环\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. It's a good luck charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.40,0:57:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以为你害怕的那个混蛋带来恶运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brings bad luck to the creep you flatten with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.64,0:58:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.28,0:58:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,知性胜过物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind over matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.40,0:58:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,知性胜过物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind over matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.08,0:58:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前席拉常那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheila used to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.44,0:58:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 她每天都变得不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, every day, she changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.44,0:58:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.12,0:58:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次有人死了 她都变得不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's after every death.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.68,0:59:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.12,0:59:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 你要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.64,0:59:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去找戴比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to see Debbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.20,0:59:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不能出门\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.68,1:00:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你待在家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to stay in.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.88,1:00:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 我非去不可 你是阻止不了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, I gotta go, and there's nothing you can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.72,1:00:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.64,1:00:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.36,1:00:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 你无权阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - You have no right to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.20,1:00:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你知道会发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you just knew what was going on…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.96,1:00:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你跟你的朋友们 发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know very much what's going on with you and your friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.44,1:00:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 大家都以为他们知道 但他们根本不了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Everybody thinks they know, but they don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.16,1:00:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me, AIice.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.88,1:00:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去瑞克 因为我没有看好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I Iost Rick because I didn't watch him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.56,1:00:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要失去你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna lose you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.68,1:00:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只剩下彼此了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all we have.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.04,1:01:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在美国有那么多小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the towns in America…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.32,1:01:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我却搬到百慕达三角洲\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I gotta move to the Bermuda Triangle.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.04,1:01:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.12,1:01:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手放在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want your hands on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.56,1:02:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.16,1:02:30.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（丽多电影院 迷失的燃烧年轻人）
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.72,1:02:32.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（大麻疯潮）
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.68,1:03:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 吉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no. - Jimmy. Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.48,1:03:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你在这里 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.20,1:03:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是送报生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, he ain't no paperman.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.12,1:03:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你不认识他 他是曲指师哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, don't you know him? That's Hot Fingers Curly.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.52,1:03:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 他真的很会跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, he really swings out hopping with a jive.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.84,1:03:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要跳舞吗 - 当然要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you want to dance? - Do I?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.44,1:04:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.20,1:06:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will it be?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.64,1:06:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快告诉我 甜心 我不想一辈子待在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, honey. I don't wanna be here forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.84,1:06:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算食物没要了你的命 你也会被这里的服务气死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the food don't kill you, the service will.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.24,1:06:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我们 艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help us, Alice!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.76,1:06:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢的口味 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mm! The usual. - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.64,1:06:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 艾莉丝 别让他那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Alice, don't let him do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.76,1:06:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}My favorite.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.36,1:06:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 快点 - 点 点 点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! Come on, no! - Eeney, meeney, miney…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.28,1:06:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 不 - 莫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, no! - …moe.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.84,1:06:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 艾莉丝 别让他那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Alice, don't let him do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.84,1:06:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 你这个小肉丸子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, you little meatball.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.52,1:06:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢灵魂食物 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love soul food. - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.20,1:06:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.92,1:06:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,多帮我带些孩子过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me more.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.60,1:07:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以下班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your shift is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.92,1:07:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要你来请我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to come and please me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.12,1:07:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手 放在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put 'em on, put 'em on, put 'em on me Put 'em on, put 'em on, put 'em on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.32,1:07:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们得快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.68,1:07:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么事 - 我开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - I'm driving.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.76,1:07:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的目标是戴比 我得阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going after Debbie. I gotta stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.92,1:07:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得阻止他 这件事我会帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta stop him. I'm with you on this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.48,1:07:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要帮你 我站在你这边 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna help you. I'm on your side, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.00,1:08:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你爱我 碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to love me. And just touch me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.68,1:08:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手 把你的手放在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands. Put your hands on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.20,1:08:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手放在我身上 把你的手放在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands on me. Put your hands on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.68,1:08:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手 放在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put 'em on, put 'em on, put 'em on me Put 'em on, put 'em on, put 'em on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.40,1:08:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.00,1:08:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们得快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.40,1:08:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么事 - 我开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - I'm driving.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.84,1:08:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手 放在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put 'em on, put 'em on, put 'em on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.84,1:08:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不相信你是真的 - 我相信你是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't believe in you. - I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.60,1:09:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有付出\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pain…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.64,1:09:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会有收获\N{\fnArial\fs30}…no gain.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.84,1:09:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的目标是戴比 我得阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going after Debbie. I gotta stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.16,1:09:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.72,1:09:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.12,1:10:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们得快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.48,1:10:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么事 - 我开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - I'm driving.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.64,1:10:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的目标是戴比 我得阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going after Debbie. I gotta stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.68,1:10:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得怪怪的 我们好像这样做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I got the weirdest feeling we've done this before.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.08,1:11:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我们得快一点 我开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We have to hurry. I'm driving.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.09,1:11:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得快一点 我开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to hurry. I'm driving.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.20,1:11:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我们两个都睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. We're both asleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.80,1:11:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我们鬼打墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got us going in circles.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.28,1:11:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.12,1:11:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以进来 但你出不去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can check in, but you can't check out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.64,1:11:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那到底是怎么一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.08,1:11:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴比 她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Debbie. She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.72,1:11:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把她带入梦里 就跟其他孩子一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've collected her, Iike the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.76,1:12:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我要撞死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm gonna punch his ticket in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.08,1:12:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Dan.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.60,1:12:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.44,1:12:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 快送他上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.00,1:12:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地 这是七号救护车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Base, this is med seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.08,1:12:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤者是白人男性 16至18岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a male Caucasian, approximately 16 to 18 years of age.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.64,1:13:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,头部跟颈部有多处撕裂伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, multiple lacerations about the head and neck area.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.36,1:13:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有内伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possible internal injuries.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.16,1:13:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 - 能让你的男朋友放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that do? - Relaxes your boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.84,1:13:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放下针筒 - 抱歉 规定就是规定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put the needle down. - Sorry, rules is rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.28,1:13:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得保持清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stays awake!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.72,1:13:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的规定 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are my rules, understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.44,1:13:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, nuts?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.24,1:13:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会过敏 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's allergic, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.60,1:13:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一开始就该跟我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have said something in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.88,1:13:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.52,1:13:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他们为你注射镇定剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't Iet them put you to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.64,1:13:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得为他准备好 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to get ready for him. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.44,1:13:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏克医生请立刻到手术室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr.Schick to OR, stat.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.52,1:13:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他什么时候动手术 - 15分钟后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When does he have surgery? - Fifteen minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.60,1:13:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他去吧 艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him be, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.16,1:13:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们会杀了他 - 你在胡说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're gonna kill him. - What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.84,1:13:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开我 - 艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me go. - Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.52,1:13:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 快回来 艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. Get back here! Alice!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.96,1:14:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.88,1:14:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.36,1:15:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 我不要麻醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No gas.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.80,1:15:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要麻醉 不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No gas. No. Don't put…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.28,1:16:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking A.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.00,1:17:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克鲁格 - 我可不是苏斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Krueger. - Well, it ain't Dr.Seuss.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.68,1:17:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice! Alice!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.40,1:17:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice! Alice!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.56,1:17:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,离他远一点 你这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from him, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.80,1:17:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丹 - 我看到他了 他刚刚在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dan. - I saw him. He was here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.40,1:17:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我们得离闭这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. We have to get out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.96,1:17:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.60,1:17:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,要逛逛吗 小情人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out for a spin, lovebirds?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.80,1:18:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹 抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.80,1:18:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice! Alice!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.96,1:18:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice, it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.60,1:18:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在大出血 让他醒过来 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hemorrhaging. Bring him out of it. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.16,1:18:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.00,1:18:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉丝 艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alice! Alice!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.72,1:18:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得立刻麻醉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta put me back under now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.80,1:18:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 孩子 我们好不容易让你醒来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, son. It was rough, but we pulled you out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.32,1:18:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.00,1:19:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛莱迪要来抓你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freddy's coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.88,1:19:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 四 锁好你的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, four, better lock your door.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.56,1:19:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,五 六 快去拿十字架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five, six, grab your crucifix.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.92,1:19:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,七 八\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven, eight…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.92,1:19:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到仙境 艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Wonderland, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.84,1:20:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有他们的能力 我有他们的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got their power. I've got their souls.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.92,1:20:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.72,1:20:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.72,1:21:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你真的能办到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you've got what it takes?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.60,1:21:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我守着我的大门 已经非常久了 臭女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been guarding my gate for a long time, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.60,1:22:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是永恒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am eternal.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.40,1:22:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我睡着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I lay me down to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.32,1:22:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦的主人会拿走我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The master of dreams. My soul, I'll keep.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.04,1:22:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我心灵之眼的倒影里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the reflection of my mind's eye…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.72,1:22:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶会看到自己 它将会死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil will see itself, and it shall die.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.76,1:23:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them out!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.08,1:23:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死定了 克鲁格\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead, Krueger.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.52,1:24:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.72,1:24:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我们 艾莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved us, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.28,1:24:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goodbye. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.00,1:25:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,下地狱去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest in hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.04,1:26:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚我睡了一整夜 我好几天没有睡得那么好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I slept through all of last night and I haven't done that in days.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.96,1:26:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是睡不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still having trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.12,1:26:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以睡上两小时 运气好的话是三小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can sleep two, maybe three hours if I'm lucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.56,1:26:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mind though.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.40,1:26:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我有理由让自己保持清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have more reasons to stay awake now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.92,1:26:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.60,1:26:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,许个愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.76,1:26:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,少来了 你竟会相信那种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, you don't believe in that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.76,1:26:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我相信 我想你也相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, I do, and I think you do too.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.60,1:26:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.20,1:26:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你许了什么愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you wish for?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.64,1:26:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出来的话就不会成真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I tell you, it won't come true.
